title: "R038: A strict parent-side lower-bound certificate for seventeen unit squares / 十七单位正方形的严格父边长下界证书"
message: "Please cite a fixed commit and retain the upstream credit listed in NOTICE.md. / 请引用固定提交并保留 NOTICE.md 中列出的上游署名。"
type: software
