repository-code: "https://github.com/Guzhou0806/n17-square-packing"
abstract: >-
  An exact computer-assisted certificate proving s(17) > 461300000000/99974999999,
  using a SHA-pinned upstream measure and complete expanded-domain event-cell replay.
  / 一份精确的计算机辅助证书，证明 s(17) > 461300000000/99974999999，
  使用 SHA 锁定的上游测度与完整扩域事件胞元复演。
keywords:
  - square packing
  - computer-assisted proof
  - lower bound
  - exact arithmetic
